<span class="tag">B2B consulting</span>
<h1>iOS Audit Sprint</h1>
<p class="lead">Fixed-price IAP rejection recovery for indie iOS founders. I shipped 7 apps to the App Store &mdash; after enough rejections to reverse-engineer what Apple's "2.1(b) IAP completeness" email actually means. 14-day refund if Apple still rejects.</p>
</header>

