<p style="color:var(--text);font-size:.92rem;margin-bottom:14px">Every app below cleared Apple review <strong>the same day</strong> I applied the fix — after the same rejection pattern that had blocked them for days or weeks. The ASC web "Add for review" toggle. The step the REST API cannot perform.</p>
